    <label>terrathyst crucible</label>
    <description>A small crystal structure with its own shocksap pool. This structure allows a tribe to shape a limited amount of lithic items and weapons.
The crucible's own shocksap reserve is self-sustaining, and small enough to replenish without running out. This allows it to be effectively unlimited; however, the tiny volume requires the user to supply additional shocksap during most processes. 
While this crucible is a good starting point and can always prove useful, there is a lithic structure out there that does every crafting aspect of the terrathyst crucible better.</description>
